# Local Postgres seed dump — a full pg_dump of a dev's own database. Kept out of
# the repo so personal plans/tasks/notes and credential hashes never leak into a
# public checkout. The fresh/public DB is seeded by scripts instead: migrate +
# bootstrap-default-user + bootstrap-service-accounts (see databases/README.md).
# A locally-generated databases/seed.sql is still baked into your own postgres
# image (see .dockerignore) — it just never gets committed.
databases/seed.sql
vite.config.*.timestamp*
vite.config.ts.timestamp*
vitest.config.*.timestamp*
vitest.config.ts.timestamp*

